{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "03d0fbeb-4b6e-8807-a368-ff855553b073",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T13:06:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:03:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. I am calling for the... the library. The Newport library. Is this the library?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. I think you've got the wrong number, but that's all right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I am sorry. I have a paper here. I wrote the number from the internet. Maybe I wrote it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Do you want to read me the number you dialed? Go slowly, I'm in no rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One moment. [pause] I dial four, zero, one, and then the rest. But my phone is from another place. I am not sure about the area code. Is it four-zero-one for Newport, or I need another one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, four-oh-one is right for Newport, and for all of Rhode Island actually. So the area code was fine. It must have been one of the other digits that was off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So the area code is good. I thought maybe the problem was this. I am a little confused with it, because I have also another number with a different area code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that can throw you off. Here's what I'd do. The library has its own main line, and I don't have it memorized to read off to you. If you look up the Newport Public Library on your phone or ask the operator, it'll come right up. Or I can transfer you over, if you'd like. Would that help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer is possible? That would be very good. But first, can I ask one thing? I need to know if the library is open today. Because I am also going to buy a snow shovel, and I went to the store this morning, and the shelves are almost empty. Only two shovels. So I want to plan my day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. Well, with the snow talk lately I'm not surprised the shovels are going fast. Hold on, let me see if I can get you the library. If they pick up, you can ask them about their hours today. It's the day after Christmas, so they may be on a different schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, thank you. Different schedule, I understand. I will ask them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm going to put you on a brief hold and transfer you. If the line drops, just search the library by name and call that number. Sound good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sound good. Thank you very much for your help, and I am sorry for the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Hold one moment, please."
    }
  ],
